                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-2">What's Wrong With Your AC?</h2>
                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Identify the issue. We have the solution.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Issue 1 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-blue-50/30 dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
